flowchart TD
    A[GUI Button Click\nStart/Stop Mic or Video Streamer] --> B[OperatorConsoleApp.start_* / stop_*]
    B --> C[_run_streamer_action(streamer, action)]
    C --> D[Background thread\n_streamer_action_worker]
    D --> E[PiStreamerManager.run_action]
    E --> F[SSH command to Pi]
    F --> G{Action}
    G -->|start| H[nohup python pi/*_udp_streamer.py\nwrite .run/*_streamer.pid]
    G -->|stop| I[kill PID from .run/*_streamer.pid\nremove pid file]
    H --> J[echo started|failed]
    I --> J2[echo stopped|already-stopped]
    J --> K[Worker updates GUI status label]
    J2 --> K
    K --> L[sleep 1s]
    L --> M[refresh_streamer_status(streamer)]
    M --> N[PiStreamerManager.query_status via SSH]
    N --> O[GUI status label: running/stopped/error]
